All Rights Reserved, except where stated below.

1. What this covers

Everything in this repository and in the jars and modpack zips built from it that was made for the pack: the code of
Jaymo's Powers (src/) and Jaymo's Kitchen (kitchen/), the art, models, animations, sounds, structures, text and data
of all three mods, the tools in tools/ and the documents in docs/, except the parts listed in section 4.

The code of Jaymo's Kingdoms is under the GNU General Public License v3 instead (section 3), because parts of it are
ported from a GPL v3 mod. Its art, models, sounds, structures, text and data that were made for the pack are covered
by this notice and are not part of that grant.

2. What you may do

If Kinslauer has given you the pack (the jars, or a Jaymos-Powers-Modpack zip) or invited you to this repository, you
may download it, install it, play it in single player, and run it on a server for players who were given it the same
way. Invited contributors may also change the code on a branch and send it back as a pull request.

Without written permission from Kinslauer you may not:
- share, re-upload, mirror or sell the jars, the modpack zip, or any part of this repository, in public or in private,
  to anyone who was not given the pack by Kinslauer;
- post the pack or any of its mods on CurseForge, Modrinth, GitHub or any other site;
- put the mods, or any of their art, models or sounds, in another modpack or mod.

3. Jaymo's Kingdoms code (GPL v3)

The Java code of Jaymo's Kingdoms (kingdoms/src/**/*.java) is a work based on Mo' Creatures (DrZhark, GNU GPL v3) and
is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3 only. Its full text is in
kingdoms/src/main/resources/licenses/mocreatures/LICENSE. That grant covers the code only, not the pack's own assets
named in section 1. Anyone given the Kingdoms jar can ask Kinslauer for its source code.

4. Parts that belong to others

These keep their own licences, which ship beside them. Nothing in this notice limits what those licences allow.
- Jaymo's Kingdoms (kingdoms/src/main/resources/licenses/): the Jaki Versatile Structures ship files (GPL v3); the
  Mo' Creatures models, animations and textures (GPL v3); the Loot Goblins textures, model, loot and ported code
  (LGPL v3); the HYG star data (CC BY-SA 4.0) and constellation lines (CC BY 4.0); the code ported from Saint's
  Dragons, Stormborn Tomb and the ideas from Runic Races and RPG Lore (MIT); polyjo's Dead Traveler (CC BY 4.0).
- Jaymo's Powers (src/main/resources/licenses/): the ported code and sprites of Iron's Simple Blood and Enchanting
  System Overhaul (MIT).
- Jaymo's Kitchen (kitchen/src/main/resources/LICENSE_*): the Rats model, animations, textures and sounds and the
  rat trap model (LGPL v3); the Horse Power parts (LGPL v3); the Farmer's Delight and Nifty Carts parts (MIT).
- The flintlock gun models (art/guns/, CC BY 4.0, makers in art/guns/CREDITS.md).
- Every other mod, resource pack and shader the modpack downloads or ships (including the MCA jar and ports/trmt),
  under its own licence. The modpack zip lists most of them for CurseForge to download, and does not relicense them.

5. Contributions

By sending a pull request or pushing to this repository you agree that your contribution is covered by this notice
(section 3 for Kingdoms code), and that Kinslauer may use, change and ship it as part of the pack.

The pack is provided as is, without any warranty.
